  "prefLabel": "Gcd 207.02 Appearances and Representation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gcd 207.02 Appearances and Representation. A party or intervenor or the representative of the party or intervenor shall file an appearance that includes the following information:\n\n(a) The docket number assigned by the commission or a brief identification of the case;\n\n(b) A statement as to whether or not the representative is an attorney and if so, whether the attorney is licensed to practice in New Hampshire; and\n\n(c) The daytime address and telephone number of the party, intervenor or representative.\n\nSource. #7635-A, eff 1-30-02; ss by #10339, eff 5-17-13",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gcd100-400.html"
